# Kconfig — Architecture Kconfig for sim
#
# Place at: arch/sim/Kconfig
#
# Defines the SIM architecture and its options.

config ARCH_SIM
	bool
	select HAS_DTS
	select HAS_KERNEL
	help
	  Universal RTOS Native Simulator architecture.
	  Uses stackful coroutines (corosensei) for thread switching and
	  virtual time for deterministic scheduling.

config ARCH
	default "sim" if ARCH_SIM

config SIMULATION_HOST_MODE
	bool "Build for host simulation mode"
	default y
	help
	  When enabled, Zephyr is compiled as a host-native library
	  linked into the Rust simulator runner.  Thread switching,
	  interrupt handling, and time keeping are delegated to the
	  Rust fiber runtime via the sim ABI.
